# expect: cut_comptime.or:6:27 - `comptime` was cut
# `comptime` was accepted in exactly one position (`= comptime EXPR`) where it
# was skipped and did nothing, while the docs listed "comptime constant folding"
# under what works. `const NAME = expr` really is folded at its read sites, so
# the keyword was a second way to say the same thing, minus the guarantee.
define version() -> text = comptime "0.0.1"

define main() -> number:
    length(version())
